# Deterministic parameters for ArduCopter's JSON + Gazebo SITL backend.
# The SITL board exposes two populated IMUs and one empty compatibility slot.
# Keeping the empty slot enabled makes the real ArduPilot pre-arm consistency
# check correctly reject the vehicle, so only that unavailable slot is disabled.
INS_USE3 0

# Keep the full ArduPilot pre-arm suite enabled and shorten only the automatic
# disarm delay that starts after ArduPilot itself has positively detected
# touchdown. ArduCopter 4.6 has a compiled 2 s motor arming delay; this value
# must remain strictly above it or auto-disarm can win the race before the
# motor interlock opens. This is not an in-flight force-disarm bypass. The
# moving-platform hard deadline remains independently enforced by ROS.
ARMING_CHECK 1
DISARM_DELAY 5
